#btn-category-group {
  height: 420px;
  transition: height 0.5s;
}
#btn-category-group.expanded {
  height: fit-content;
}
```

And then, you can use jQuery to add or remove the `expanded` class from the div:

```javascript
$("#btn-category-group").addClass("expanded");
```

