The `wait_event_interruptible` function has been modified to add the current task to the task list when waiting and remove it when finished waiting. This allows multiple tasks to wait on the same wait queue head.

The `wake_up_all` function has been modified to give a notification to each task in the task list using `xTaskNotifyGiveFromISR`.

