- Appends the worksheet to the workbook
- Converts the workbook to a binary Excel file using the `writeFile` function
- Saves the Excel file with the name "table.xlsx"

Make sure to replace the ID "ECR" with the actual ID of your table. You can also customize the name and format of the exported Excel file.

