using System.IO;
```

3. Load the existing workbook or create a new one. For example:
```csharp
XSSFWorkbook workbook;
using (FileStream file = new FileStream("path_to_your_workbook.xlsx", FileMode.Open, FileAccess.Read))
{
    workbook = new XSSFWorkbook(file);
}
```

4. Get a reference to the worksheet where you want to add the image link:
```csharp
