    this.Paint += new PaintEventHandler(Form1_Paint);
}
```

4. Build and run the project. You will see a window with a rectangle that is rotated by 45 degrees. You can modify the `angle` variable to rotate the rectangle by a different angle.

Note that this approach rotates the entire graphics object, so any subsequent drawing will also be rotated. If you want to rotate only the rectangle and keep other graphics unaffected, you can use a different approach.

