To send and receive messages between a content script and a background script in a Chrome extension and log them on the console, you can use the `chrome.runtime.sendMessage` method in the sender script (content script or popup) and listen for messages using `chrome.runtime.onMessage` in the receiver script (background script). Here's an example:

