    /* Skip no questions if neither option1 nor option2 is selected */
    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('skipQuestionID2', false);
    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('skipQuestionID3', false);
  }
});
```

In this example, `question1` represents the response selected in question ID1. Depending on the response values, skip logic is implemented using `Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData` to set embedded data variables. You can then configure the skip logic using these embedded data variables in the Qualtrics survey flow.

3. After writing your skip logic code, save your changes and preview/test your survey to ensure the skip logic behaves as expected.

