3. Create a Cloud SQL instance: In the Cloud Console, navigate to the Cloud SQL section, and click on "Create Instance" to create a new instance. Choose "MySQL" as the database engine, select the desired region and other configuration options, and click "Create."

4. Create a database: After the instance is created, click on its name, go to the "Databases" tab, and click on "Create Database" to create a new MySQL database.

